000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          TRPTR7.
000400 AUTHOR.              BARBARA J. PLUM.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        FEB 17, 1982.
000600*DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.             THIS PROGRAM WILL PRINT A REPORT, SORTED
001000*                     BY VENDOR CODE NUMBER, LISTING ALL CORPORATE
001100*                     CODES BELOW EXPEDITE WITH AND DESPITE OPEN
001200*                     PURCHASE ORDERS.
001300*                     ALL QUANTITIES ON THE DOCK ARE TREATED AS
001400*                     IF ONHAND, BEFORE THE DETERMINATION IS MADE.
001500*
001600*                     JULY 2, 1982, THE BUFFER AREAS - DPOITEM,
001700*                     DPORECD, AND MSTORERM - WERE CHANGED IN
001800*                     PREPARATION FOR THE NEW DATA BASE CHANGES.
001900*                     B.J.P.
002000*
002100*                     OCTOBER 20, 1982, CORRECTED THREE LOGIC
002200*                     ERRORS IN THE ROUTINE "HDR-3-INFO-CONT".
002300*                     ONE ERROR WAS THE OVERLAY OF A VALID
002400*                     CONTACT AND PHONE NUMBER IF THE DVENDOR
002500*                     SEGMENT HAD ANY INFORMATION AFTER "09".
002600*                     ANOTHER ERROR WAS THAT NO PHONE NUMBER
002700*                     WOULD PRINT UNLESS THERE WAS A CONTACT
002800*                     IN THE DATABASE.  THE LAST ERROR WAS THAT
002900*                     IF THE COND-WORD WAS ANYTHING BUT 0 OR
003000*                     15, THE PROGRAM WOULD NOT BLOW-DOWN, BUT
003100*                     IT WOULD LOOP.  LMB.
003200*
003300*                     JANUARY 20, 1983, CORRECTED THE PROGRAM SO
003400*                     THAT THE LINE COUNTER WOULD CHANGE TO A
003500*                     NEW PAGE AT THE RIGHT TIME.  B.J.P.
003600*
003700*                     JULY 19, 1984;  EXPANDED PRINTOUT OF STOREROOM
003800*                          INSURANCE STATUS FLAG TO PRINT NOT ONLY
003900*                          WHEN "X" IS MARKED FOR INSURANCE, BUT
004000*                          ALSO WHEN "C" IS MARKED FOR CRITICAL AND
004100*                          "B" FOR BOTH.  -B. WINTER.
004200*
004300*                ADDED INTERNATIONAL DATE ROTUINE "TDATECHK"
004400*                ON MAY 15, 1985.   V.W.D.
004500*
004600*                     JAN, 1987:  REWROTE ENTIRE PROGRAM USING ALL
004700*                     PROGRAMMING STANDARDS IN USE AT THIS TIME.
004800*                     THE FOLLOWING HAS BEEN ADDED:
004900*                      -TRSCREEN FOR FRONT END REPORT OPTIONS
005000*                      -ADDED OPTION TO PRINT FOR A SPECIFIC RANGE
005100*                       OF CORPORATE CODES
005200*                      -CHANGED THE HEADER PAGE TO COME FROM THDPRT2
005300*                       INSTEAD OF BEING HARD-CODED
005400*                      -PRINT COMPRESSION FEATURE
005500*                      -NON-HP LOGIC
005600*                      -CHANGED TO USE COPYLIB FOR ALL DATA SET
005700*                       BUFFER DESCRIPTIONS
005800*                      -CHANGED COPY STATEMENTS TO "IN COPYCSIS"
005900*                      -ADDED CALLS TO "SONORDER" AND "CDESC"
006000*                      -CHANGED MONEY FIELD SIZE TO 9(11)V9(4)
006100*                                      C.R. KALMAN.
006200*
006300*
      *C*   JUNE 3, 1994      CR KALMAN
      *C*   ADDED CALL TO NEW COBOL ERROR HANDLER.
      *C*
      *C  09/13/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C    EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C    RECOMPILE TO PICK UP COPYLIB CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  19MAY1997  DAVE PLUM
      *C    REVISED TO CORRECT A PROBLEM WITH THE PAGE-TABLE.
      *C    UNDER SOME CIRCUMSTANCES THIS PROGRAM WAS BLOWING UP
      *C    WHEN ATTEMPTING TO USE ROW NUMBER 61 OF THE 60 ROW
      *C    TABLE.  THE ERROR WAS AN MCH0603.
      *C

