032800 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING HD-ROUTE-DATA DATA-LINE.
032900
033200 MAIN SECTION.
033400
033500 0-START.
033600     PERFORM 1-HOUSEKEEPING.
033700     PERFORM 6-MAIN.
033800     PERFORM 2-END-OF-JOB.
033900     GOBACK.
034100
034200 1-HOUSEKEEPING.
9406CK     MOVE "C" TO SCOPE.
9406CK     CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING SCOPE.
034300     MOVE "TRPTR7" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
034400
034500     CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.
034700     MOVE CHAR-1636PI TO COMPRESS-PRINT.
034900     MOVE CHAR-10PI   TO NORMAL-PRINT.
035500
           OPEN INPUT DVENDOR DPORECD MSTORERM DDESC DPOITEM MPLTINFO.
036200 6-MAIN.
036300
036400     SORT SORT-FILE
036500          ON ASCENDING KEY      SORT-VEND-CODE
036600                                SORT-CODE
036700                                SORT-PO-RECV-NO
036800          INPUT  PROCEDURE IS  7-INPUT THRU 7-END
036900          OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS  8-OUTPUT THRU 8-END.
037000
037200 2-END-OF-JOB.
037300     WRITE PRINT-REC FROM NORMAL-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0.
037400
037500     CLOSE DVENDOR DPORECD MSTORERM DDESC DPOITEM MPLTINFO.
038000     CLOSE PRINT-FILE.
038100
038200     GOBACK.
038400
038500 2-BLOWUP.
038600     WRITE PRINT-REC FROM NORMAL-PRINT AFTER ADVANCING 0.
038700
038800     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
038900          VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
039000          BU-DISPLAY-AREA.
039300 7-INPUT.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE SPACES TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC.
           START MSTORERM KEY >= CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
041200
041300 7-GET-NEW-CODE.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ MSTORERM NEXT INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
041900        GO TO 7-END.
042000
042800 7-CHECK-CODE.
043000
043100     IF CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"
043200        GO TO 7-GET-NEW-CODE.
043300
043400     IF SORT-ON-RANGE
043500        IF CORP-CODE IS LESS THAN BEG-RANGE
043600           OR CORP-CODE IS GREATER THAN END-RANGE
043700           GO TO 7-GET-NEW-CODE.
043800
043900     IF STR-STOCK-OT = "X"
044000        GO TO 7-GET-NEW-CODE.
044100
044200     MOVE ZEROES TO AVAILABLE.
044300     COMPUTE AVAILABLE = STR-ONHAND - STR-RESERVED.
044400     IF AVAILABLE IS LESS THAN STR-EXPEDITE
044500        NEXT SENTENCE
044600     ELSE
