094000*****IF TBL-IND IS GREATER THAN 60   *REPLACED 19MAY1997*
           IF TBL-IND IS GREATER THAN 59
094100        MOVE 1 TO PRT-IND
094200        PERFORM 8-PRINT-HDR
094300        PERFORM 8-PRINT-TABLE
094400                UNTIL PRT-IND EQUAL CODE-START
094500        MOVE 7 TO SUB
094600        PERFORM 8-CLEAN-TABLE
094700                UNTIL SUB IS GREATER THAN 60
094800        MOVE NEW-LINE TO TBL-IND.
094900
095000
095100 8-PRINT-TABLE.
095200     IF PRT-IND IS EQUAL TO 1
095300        WRITE PRINT-REC FROM PAGE-TBL (PRT-IND)
095400           AFTER ADVANCING NEW-PAGE
095500     ELSE
095600        WRITE PRINT-REC FROM PAGE-TBL (PRT-IND).
095700     ADD 1 TO PRT-IND.
095800
095900
096000 8-CLEAN-TABLE.
096100     IF PRT-IND IS LESS THAN 61
096200        MOVE PAGE-TBL (PRT-IND) TO PAGE-TBL (SUB)
096300        ADD 1 TO PRT-IND, SUB
096400        MOVE SUB TO NEW-LINE
096500     ELSE
